# Resend API key for the contact form (https://resend.com — free tier).
# Create a free account using solvrex.official@gmail.com so emails to that inbox work
# without domain verification. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the key.
RESEND_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the sender. Defaults to onboarding@resend.dev (works with no
# DNS setup). After verifying solvrex.in in Resend, set e.g. "Solvrex <hello@solvrex.in>".
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=Solvrex <onboarding@resend.dev>

# Optional: override the recipient (defaults to solvrex.official@gmail.com).
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=solvrex.official@gmail.com
